(An Urgent Message:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If you suspect that someone in your family has pneumonia, it is vital) Tj T*
(that you call your doctor without a moment?s delay. If it is pneumonia,) Tj T*
(hours will count. Newly introduced drugs have proved of great value in) Tj T*
(curing pneumonia but early medical treatment and prompt nursing care) Tj T*
(are necessary if the new treatment is to do the most good.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(That you may know something about pneumonia, the kind of medical) Tj T*
(treatment and nursing care required, and the ways by which the disease) Tj T*
(may be prevented, this pamphlet is sent to you.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                       Life Conservation Service) Tj T*
(                                of the) Tj T*
(                       John Hancock Mutual Life) Tj T*
(                           Insurance Company) Tj T*
(                       of Boston, Massachusetts) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                               PNEUMONIA) Tj T*
(                        ITS CARE AND PREVENTION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Pneumonia is an inflammation of the lungs. Despite all the progress) Tj T*
(recently made in the treatment of the disease, it remains among the) Tj T*
(most common causes of death. Pneumonia is always a serious matter, and) Tj T*
(should be regarded as an emergency calling for immediate medical care.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The inflammation of the lungs may be due to one of a number of) Tj T*
(different kinds of germ, but the bacteria known as pneumococci cause) Tj T*
(about four cases out of every five. There are several varieties, or) Tj T*
(types, of pneumococci and the treatment may vary with the type. Your) Tj T*
(doctor has at his command some new drugs[A] but for some types of) Tj T*
(pneumonia he may combine the drug with a curative serum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([A] The different members of this new family of drugs, sulfanilamide,) Tj T*
(sulfapyridine, sulfathiazol, etc. are used depending upon the nature of) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
7 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 6 0 R >>
